Error: Jet.BuildActionAuthorityDenied: Build action `stamp` of workspace member `member` asks for ungranted `Exec` authority
 Why: Source declaration makes authority auditable but does not grant it. Invocation, package, and workspace policy cap ambient effects independently.
 Fix: Grant `Exec` in `member`'s package authority or in the workspace's `policy: { grants: { "member": #(Exec) } }`; `--allow` grants the root build only
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.BuildActionAuthorityDenied
